            <div xml:id="d291">

                <pb facs="0356" n="348" sameAs="frus:frus1941v07/pg348"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/4305: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >White</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-09-02T17:00:00-05:00">September 2, 1941—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>161. Haitian Government has decided to pay one-third interest coupons deferred
                    April 1st and full payment coupons due October 1st.</p>
                <p>Whenever you obtain the formal notice I respectfully suggest that you assist
                    Haitian Government to obtain proper publicity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
